					"id": "example-decode",
					"canonicalHex": "<lowercase-even-length-canonical-input-hex>"
				},
				"semantics": "Decode canonicalHex under the authoritative grammar. Success returns the decoded JSON-transport value. A grammar-owned malformed case reports its category through the declared decode-failure adapter. The unsafe-integral scalar Float64 case remains outside this governed corpus."
			},
			"validate-cases": {
				"caseFields": ["id", "request"],
				"semantics": "Classify each input-only request against the registry, cross-major, signed-field and replica-local wire rules. The reason is an output and is intentionally absent here.",
